# The production baseline carries CRLF inside function bodies because that is
# how production stores them. With core.autocrlf=true git would rewrite those
# bytes on commit and checkout, and every replay would then differ from
# production on 111 function bodies without anything reporting an error.
# Verified once by supabase db diff --linked; keep it verifiable.
supabase/migrations/*.sql        -text
supabase/migrations-archive/**   -text
